            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument was established in 2000 and is located in Adams County, Pennsylvania, but is placed in the municipality of Gettysburg in Pennsylvania because Adams County, Pennsylvania has Carroll County, Maryland to its southeast."
